{
 "encounter_id": "00782",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Morning. My hands are stiff in the morning. Both. About an hour."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has that been happening?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A while. I can't say exactly. A few months. Or longer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which joints?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Knuckles. Fingers. Wrists a bit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it get better as the day goes on? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. By lunchtime I'm fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling in the joints?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Maybe a little in the knuckles. No redness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other joint pain, like your feet, knees, or back?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Just hands."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does anyone in the family have arthritis?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had rheumatoid arthritis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any psoriasis, or rashes? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Skin's fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure. That's all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at your hands. Put them out in front of you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like this?",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's slight swelling over several knuckles in both hands, and they're tender when I squeeze across them."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that arthritis? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "With an hour of morning stiffness, swollen knuckles, and your mother's history, this fits with an inflammatory arthritis, I'd say probable early rheumatoid arthritis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Rheumatoid. Like my mother. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's treatable, and treating it early prevents damage. I'd like to arrange blood tests and X-rays of both hands, and refer you to the rheumatology team."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The specialist will see you within a few weeks. I'll mark it urgent."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And in the meantime? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep your hands warm and moving, and do gentle exercises, like making a fist and opening it, every morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If your joints become very swollen, you get a fever, or you can't use your hands, ring us."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
